", "start": 1850, "end": 1982, "text": "\"This discovery is a testament to the power of historical research and the importance of preserving our cultural heritage,\" said Dr."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1983, "end": 2037, "text": "James Wilson, a historian at the University of Oxford."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2038, "end": 2210, "text": "\"The marriage of Isabella Louisa Gordon and Robert French Handcock serves as a reminder of the complex and fascinating lives of individuals who shaped our collective past.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2211, "end": 2346, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Isabella Louisa Gordon was indeed married to Robert French Handcock."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2347, "end": 2537, "text": "This remarkable finding offers a fresh perspective on the lives of these two intriguing individuals, providing a unique window into the social and cultural landscape of 19th-century Britain."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Annie Phillips", "Robert French Handcock"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Annie Phillips", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Robert French Handcock", "origin": "initial"}]}

